OpenOL-Relay: call server_drain_snaps in the CLI main loop. Without it the late-join snapshot queue (pickups, matinee and hero state, and the automatic door/enemy/pushable replay) is filled but never sent. Against b9def512 src/. Apply: patch -p1 -d src < this file. Tests: harness/relay_state_test.py S9 to S13.

--- a/main.cpp
+++ b/main.cpp
@@ -157,6 +157,7 @@
 
         run_heartbeat(g_server);
         run_timeout(g_server);
+        server_drain_snaps(g_server);   /* the CLI loop never drained the late-join snapshot queue */
 
         if (cli_poll())
             cli_dispatch(g_server, cli_last_cmd);
